{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_59623779fd27423a9342ca4c1a2d9753","id":"pg_3bd79191f322549590488b61f7cbf33b","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/storozhenko98-beehive-changelog-md-42e6a36ead6d-8b61f7cbf33b.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_0e95558fec195772aa001c4048a9d6f4"],"title":"storozhenko98/beehive/CHANGELOG.md @ 42e6a36ead6d","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_59623779fd27423a9342ca4c1a2d9753"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_01dad8755d56e23ff2114116f6ef9d2da514ffedd26f4e22f61f1dbbd5526a60"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Features include agent panes that launch Claude Code or any CLI agent alongside terminals, per-repo custom quick-launch buttons, comb copying including uncommitted work, live branch tracking in the sidebar, and persisted pane layouts."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2beb77f7a345330d0bcacbcbce2460a0930e9d991b9c71bfd8560ae6ae296daf"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"A configured comb startup command (e.g. a tmux session) runs once per comb the first time it opens after launch, after which the app returns to an interactive shell in the comb directory."},{"claim_ids":["clm_2e576ab97c2e79a693a8e71847686f1e97e7775536c3939b38d7f38c43289996"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The TUI installs via a curl-piped shell script, asks the user to choose 'bh' or 'beehive' as the command name, and auto-updates on startup."},{"claim_ids":["clm_577c573ac08f2c59f35c0caa230d4f25b408c0638717f52734e90eab30693f7a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The tool appears aimed at developers juggling several GitHub repositories who want parallel terminal and CLI coding-agent sessions in branch-isolated workspace clones."},{"claim_ids":["clm_62c7798048e0abc4aebb8f99465867cc639cb0e5b09df9ed851b767195795cbc"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: the GUI is built with npm install plus 'npm run tauri dev' for hot-reload development or 'npm run tauri build' for production, the TUI is built with cargo build --release from cli/, and CONTRIBUTING.md covers development setup and guidelines."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8da932825b83edab2503cd1c5f3019f0ca5989f56da48e992e32ef5028100d00"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The GUI and TUI share the same config and data, so they can be used interchangeably."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8fbbcae4b3e7601e55a3fd4ff366aa3b9c5f9613880267d6767d494e21252bb8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Beehive manages multiple repos, creates isolated workspace clones on different branches, and runs terminals and AI agents side-by-side from one window, shipped as both a desktop GUI app and a terminal TUI."},{"claim_ids":["clm_9318896033ea98e9bd4a004a4e90ace8a2089539965fd310e76198cd7a871a78"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Beehive requires git and the GitHub CLI for all usage, and gh authentication is required because repo operations use gh."},{"claim_ids":["clm_a6fd43fa068e6a5bcea4ac2574521f21a5e5364b22166d97f840873f20475cbd"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The desktop GUI is macOS-only for now; the standalone TUI supports macOS (Apple Silicon) and Linux x86_64 glibc, and Windows support is not yet available. Intel macOS is listed as untested for both."},{"claim_ids":["clm_af7a824e112bc52df5caa478cc7d9dc499f65ba88f954ba72d2e08dd80674eca"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The stack comprises a React 19/TypeScript/Vite frontend with xterm.js, a Rust Tauri v2 backend using portable-pty, a Ratatui/Crossterm-based Rust TUI, and git operations performed by shelling out to git and gh CLIs."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c1adb2b1147ec6f84f148d0285e36afc14758bcc7f7345c75960af6fb064dfce"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md serves as AI-assistant context and documents contributor commands such as cargo check for Rust type-checking and npx tsc --noEmit for TypeScript type-checking."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dd55c69d5005028b0dfed90135949124ae4014fc5c02d38f1e06c9ccd8e84e87"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"All config lives under ~/.beehive/: config.json for app settings, a beehive.json directory marker, and per-hive .hive/state.json holding repo info, nests, combs, pane layouts, and custom buttons; combs are full git clones on disk."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f7df7f857e532e480fce3e683a625b5e05bd9e18eee92dcd83d9af1669ab6b5b"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The TUI binary can set the comb startup command programmatically via a --startup-cmd flag, and passing an empty string clears it, per the documented examples."}],"claim_ids":["clm_01dad8755d56e23ff2114116f6ef9d2da514ffedd26f4e22f61f1dbbd5526a60","clm_2beb77f7a345330d0bcacbcbce2460a0930e9d991b9c71bfd8560ae6ae296daf","clm_2e576ab97c2e79a693a8e71847686f1e97e7775536c3939b38d7f38c43289996","clm_577c573ac08f2c59f35c0caa230d4f25b408c0638717f52734e90eab30693f7a","clm_62c7798048e0abc4aebb8f99465867cc639cb0e5b09df9ed851b767195795cbc","clm_8da932825b83edab2503cd1c5f3019f0ca5989f56da48e992e32ef5028100d00","clm_8fbbcae4b3e7601e55a3fd4ff366aa3b9c5f9613880267d6767d494e21252bb8","clm_9318896033ea98e9bd4a004a4e90ace8a2089539965fd310e76198cd7a871a78","clm_a6fd43fa068e6a5bcea4ac2574521f21a5e5364b22166d97f840873f20475cbd","clm_af7a824e112bc52df5caa478cc7d9dc499f65ba88f954ba72d2e08dd80674eca","clm_c1adb2b1147ec6f84f148d0285e36afc14758bcc7f7345c75960af6fb064dfce","clm_dd55c69d5005028b0dfed90135949124ae4014fc5c02d38f1e06c9ccd8e84e87","clm_f7df7f857e532e480fce3e683a625b5e05bd9e18eee92dcd83d9af1669ab6b5b"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:44Z","created_by_operation":"op_59623779fd27423a9342ca4c1a2d9753","id":"pg_c2ba0f83d8d852658a1f82cad72ec6da","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/storozhenko98-beehive-readme-md-42e6a36ead6d-82cad72ec6da.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_686f3df186985394a61f2568e44dec41"],"title":"storozhenko98/beehive/README.md @ 42e6a36ead6d","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:44Z","updated_by_operation":"op_59623779fd27423a9342ca4c1a2d9753"}
